<title>ETHIOPIA: Ethiopian air force plane crashes.</title>
<headline>Ethiopian air force plane crashes.</headline>
<dateline>ADDIS ABABA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Ethiopian air force plane crashed near a market on Wednesday and several people may have died, witnesses said.</p>
<p>They said the plane, on a training flight, crashed at Mojo some 70 km (40 miles) south of Addis Ababa and people on the ground and in the plane may have perished in the ensuing fire.</p>
</text>
